WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Sam Whitfield: The new market data shows our engineering bands are trailing the seventy-fifth percentile in two regions.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Maria Chen: Which levels are most affected, is this concentrated at senior levels or broader?

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Sam Whitfield: It's concentrated at senior and staff engineer levels specifically.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Maria Chen: Let's model the cost of a targeted band adjustment before the merit cycle guide goes out.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Sam Whitfield: I'll have modeling ready for review by the end of the week.
